From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 11:29:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/9] arm64: dts: qcom: kaanapali-oneplus-iceland: drop the
 -optin names of the default thermal includes

The shell zone, the QMX backstops and the Horae shell sensor are part of
the default device tree since q91e-r2, but their include files still carry
the -optin suffix and an "opt-in, rehearsal only" header. Rename them to
kaanapali-oneplus-iceland-{thermal,qmx,horae}.dtsi and reword the headers.
Comments and file names only: the built DTB is unchanged.

The thermal and horae files are generated (wf/cmpimpl/scripts/gen-thermal-dt.py,
wf/q91d/s/gen-horae-dt.py); the generators' output names and header text
must follow this change.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
---
 ...orae-optin.dtsi => kaanapali-oneplus-iceland-horae.dtsi} | 2 +-
 ...nd-qmx-optin.dtsi => kaanapali-oneplus-iceland-qmx.dtsi} | 4 ++--
 ...al-optin.dtsi => kaanapali-oneplus-iceland-thermal.dtsi} | 6 +++---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts      | 6 +++---
 4 files changed, 9 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)
 rename arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/{kaanapali-oneplus-iceland-horae-optin.dtsi => kaanapali-oneplus-iceland-horae.dtsi} (94%)
 rename arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/{kaanapali-oneplus-iceland-qmx-optin.dtsi => kaanapali-oneplus-iceland-qmx.dtsi} (94%)
 rename arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/{kaanapali-oneplus-iceland-thermal-optin.dtsi => kaanapali-oneplus-iceland-thermal.dtsi} (97%)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland-horae-optin.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland-horae.dtsi
similarity index 94%
rename from arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland-horae-optin.dtsi
rename to arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland-horae.dtsi
index c0c976d93..27e2ca64d 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland-horae-optin.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland-horae.dtsi
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
